# .graphifyignore — C# / Unity (code graph carve-out)
#
# Copied into the repo checkout at build time from the VAULT-side copy at
# graphify/<repo>/.graphifyignore, which is the reviewable, committed one.
# PURE DENYLIST — never add a `!negation` line; negation is not available here.
#
# Scope for this stack is `Assets/Scripts/`. Everything Unity generates around
# it — Library/, Temp/, .meta sidecars, imported plugin source — is noise that
# would otherwise dominate the graph.

# --- Unity machine state (never source) ------------------------------------
Library/
Temp/
Obj/
obj/
Bin/
bin/
Build/
Builds/
Logs/
UserSettings/
MemoryCaptures/
Recordings/
*.meta

# --- imported / third-party --------------------------------------------------
Assets/Plugins/
Assets/ThirdParty/
Assets/Standard Assets/
Packages/
node_modules/

# --- generated ---------------------------------------------------------------
*.Designer.cs
*.g.cs
Assets/Scripts/Generated/

# --- build & config manifests ----------------------------------------------
*.csproj
*.sln
*.unityproj
ProjectSettings/
manifest.json
packages-lock.json
Dockerfile
Dockerfile.*
entrypoint.sh
.env
.env.*

# --- tests and test scaffolding --------------------------------------------
Tests/
test/
tests/
Assets/Tests/
*Tests.cs
*Test.cs
*.test.*
*.spec.*

# --- assets, docs, media (not code) ----------------------------------------
*.md
docs/
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.psd
*.fbx
*.prefab
*.unity
*.asset
*.mat
